---
// Final V2.1 — verschlankt: klarer Haupt-CTA „Angebote", 2 leise Nebenwege, kompakter Newsletter
---

<section id="abschluss" class="final2 on-dark">
  <div class="sun-strip" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container final2-inner">
    <p class="final2-eyebrow">So gibst du deinem Leben einen Sinn.</p>
    <h2>Schau dir an, womit wir dich begleiten.</h2>
    <p class="final2-lead">
      Online oder vor Ort. Allein oder als Paar.
      <em>Such dir in Ruhe aus, was sich für dich gerade stimmig anfühlt.</em>
    </p>

    <div class="final2-ctas">
      <a href="/angebote" class="btn btn-primary">Angebote ansehen</a>
      <a href="/angebote#frei" class="final2-link">Oder erstmal kostenlos reinschnuppern <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .final2 {
    background: var(--sunset-surface);
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(90px, 12vw, 140px) 0 clamp(70px, 9vw, 110px);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .final2::before {
    content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(44,75,123,0.5) 0%, rgba(44,75,123,0.1) 60%, rgba(44,75,123,0) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .sun-strip { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 6px; background: var(--sun-strip); z-index: 2; }
  .final2-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 680px; }
  .final2-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 21px); color: var(--rose); margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .final2 h2 { color: #fff; margin: 0 0 18px; font-weight: 600; }
  .final2-lead { font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 20px); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 auto 36px; max-width: 560px; }
  .final2-lead em { color: #fff; font-style: italic; font-family: var(--font-display); }
  .final2-ctas { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 18px; }
  .final2-link { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1.5px solid transparent; padding-bottom: 2px; }
  .final2-link:hover { color: #fff; border-bottom-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); text-decoration: none; }
  .final2-link .arrow { display: inline-block; transition: transform .25s var(--ease); }
  .final2-link:hover .arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }
</style>
